ard. The landlord has already committed a 2 (one of the strongest cards), and I still hold both remaining 2s plus the BlackJoker. By passing, I preserve my strongest weapon for a more critical moment - either to gain control later in the game when it matters more, or to help my teammate when they need it. Since my teammate has 16 cards (the most of any player), they may need more strategic support later. Sacrificing my BlackJoker now just to win one trick is not worth it.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
